    entry .emit   a value's text in blocks of the `Buffering`'s capacity, each handed to a function
        `Json.Printable.emit(value, deliver)`: no text of the whole value is ever built.
    entry .fromEncodable   the bridge from the tree: a printer which encodes the value and writes its tree compactly
    entry .declared   the printer a type generated with `derives Json.Direct`
    entry .Direct   the base class of generated printers; implements `write` over a neutral carrier
